# =============================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages — Security headers (Easy PDF Local)
# Formato: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# Contexto:
#   - SPA 100% client-side (Vite + React + PWA)
#   - GA4 (gtag) + Google AdSense + Funding Choices (CMP)
#   - Web Workers locais (pdfWorker) + Tesseract.js OCR (jsDelivr)
#   - pdf.js / pdf-lib (blob: / data:)
#   - Imagens de afiliados (Amazon, Mercado Livre, CDNs HTTPS)
#   - Google Fonts (Inter)
#
# Headers aplicados em /* :
#   X-Frame-Options DENY .............. anti-clickjacking
#   X-Content-Type-Options nosniff .... anti MIME sniffing
#   Referrer-Policy ................... não vaza path cross-origin
#   Permissions-Policy ................ desliga APIs sensíveis
#   Strict-Transport-Security ......... HSTS 1 ano + preload
#
# Content-Security-Policy (CSP) — diretivas:
#   default-src 'self'
#     Fallback: só mesma origem se uma diretiva faltar.
#
#   script-src
#     'self' + 'unsafe-inline' (snippets gtag/consent/AdSense no index.html).
#     Google: GTM, GA, pagead2, googleadservices, doubleclick, tpc,
#     fundingchoices, ep1/ep2 ad traffic quality (sodar), www.google.com,
#     www.gstatic.com (libs auxiliares do Google).
#     jsDelivr: tesseract.js worker (OCR em Extrair Texto).
#     Cloudflare Insights (opcional).
#
#   style-src
#     'self' + 'unsafe-inline' (CSS Vite/Tailwind) + fonts.googleapis.com.
#
#   img-src
#     'self' data: blob: https: — previews PDF, ícones, OG, banners afiliados.
#
#   font-src
#     'self' data: fonts.gstatic.com — Inter e fontes embutidas.
#
#   connect-src
#     Beacons GA4, AdSense/DoubleClick/TPC, Funding Choices, ep1/ep2,
#     Google Fonts (CSS/fetch), jsDelivr (workers/lang data Tesseract),
#     Cloudflare Insights + GTM.
#
#   frame-src
#     Iframes de anúncios, consent CMP, google.com e ep1/ep2.
#
#   worker-src
#     'self' blob: + cdn.jsdelivr.net — Vite ?worker, pdf.js e Tesseract worker.
#
#   child-src
#     'self' blob: — fallback legado alinhado a workers.
#
#   object-src 'none' | base-uri 'self' | form-action 'self' | frame-ancestors 'none'
#     Hardening clássico XSS / plugin / form hijack / framing.
#
#   media-src / manifest-src
#     PWA + blobs locais de mídia.
#
# Sem nonce por enquanto (complexidade em estático). Sem 'unsafe-eval' de
# propósito — se AdSense ainda falhar com eval, avalie como último recurso.
# =============================================================================

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com https://www.googleadservices.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://tpc.googlesyndication.com https://fundingchoicesmessages.google.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://ep1.adtrafficquality.google https://ep2.adtrafficquality.google https://www.google.com https://www.gstatic.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://www.google-analytics.com https://region1.google-analytics.com https://analytics.google.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://tpc.googlesyndication.com https://fundingchoicesmessages.google.com https://ep1.adtrafficquality.google https://ep2.adtrafficquality.google https://cloudflareinsights.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://fonts.googleapis.com https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; frame-src 'self' https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net https://tpc.googlesyndication.com https://fundingchoicesmessages.google.com https://www.google.com https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com https://ep1.adtrafficquality.google https://ep2.adtrafficquality.google; worker-src 'self' blob: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; child-src 'self' blob:; media-src 'self' blob: data:; manifest-src 'self'

# =============================================================================
# PÓS-DEPLOY — checklist obrigatório
# 1) DevTools → Console: filtre "Content Security Policy" / "Refused to"
# 2) Teste Extrair Texto com OCR (Tesseract worker via jsDelivr)
# 3) Confirme Google Fonts (sem erro em fonts.googleapis.com no connect-src)
# 4) Confirme AdSense (sodar2.js em ep2.adtrafficquality.google)
# 5) Teste ferramenta PDF (upload + processar + preview) e Blog
# 6) GA4 Realtime (page_view / tool_view)
# 7) Validadores: securityheaders.com · CSP Evaluator (Google)
# =============================================================================
